00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:35.920
Yeah. It was some Capcom game, but yeah, that's not the point.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:41.920
Anyway, you know, we're starting to see a lot of shmups incorporate this idea of like, well, one hit is kind of rough.

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:44.400
So maybe there's a way to give the player like extra chances.

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:45.440
